      <title>一起教育发布教师智能体，AI如何成为老师的同行者</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/edudaily/post/20260821/%E4%B8%80%E8%B5%B7%E6%95%99%E8%82%B2%E5%8F%91%E5%B8%83%E6%95%99%E5%B8%88%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD%E4%BD%93AI%E5%A6%82%E4%BD%95%E6%88%90%E4%B8%BA%E8%80%81%E5%B8%88%E7%9A%84%E5%90%8C%E8%A1%8C%E8%80%85/</link>
